## Description

Introducing Bot Mode for Hermes Desktop.  Your agent profiles become a series of named Bots. Each Bot has its own role, model, memory, skills and profile picture; Bots can use any model and even communicate with each other.   Build a specialist Bot once to use it forever. https://t.co/AYWD9Ro2I1

